  "fields": {
    "title": "Animation",
    "textContent": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Description",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "There are different ways to integrate animations into a website. They can be static, like displaying a video or gif, or interactive and dynamic. This means, that there can be elements, that are for example animated based on the cursor position or the scrolling of the page. Animating elements on a website can be done in different ways:",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "ordered-list",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "CSS for simple animations: You probably already know that CSS is used to style the elements on a website. But you can also use CSS to create simple animations. For example, you can move an element, change its color, size, or make it fade in and out. You can use e.g. transitions or ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "target": {
                          "sys": {
                            "id": "61aVmYIGxb3YW3gRUMKoVs",
                            "type": "Link",
                            "linkType": "Entry"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "keyframe animations",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " and ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "target": {
                          "sys": {
                            "id": "5Kqa2ZyANgkNAtfUxAU1KP",
                            "type": "Link",
                            "linkType": "Entry"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "hover",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " as a trigger.",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "SVG Animations: ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/SVG_animation_with_SMIL"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "SMIL",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " (Synchronized Multimedia Integration Language) makes it possible to animate SVG files.",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "JavaScript and animation libraries for more complex animations: JavaScript gives you more control over the timing and sequence of animations. There are various frameworks that make it easier to create interactive animations, like ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://gsap.com/"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "GSAP",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " or ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://animejs.com/"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "Anime.js",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": ".",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "HTML video element for video files: Probably the easiest (but also most boring) way to integrate motion into your website is loading a video or gif file on your website using the html <video> element (or <img> for gifs). But keep in mind that this will affect the speed and performance of your website, as video files are quite large in most cases. You can of course also embed youtube or vimeo players on your site. A library that makes it easy to display animations in a lightweight way with some more interaction possibilities is ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "Lottie"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "Lottie",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": ". Lottie is a vector-based animation file format, which can be exported as as a json-file in Adobe After Effects (with a plugin).",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Possibilities",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Here are some ideas, which animation techniques, tools and frameworks can be used (or combined) to create unique, interactive experiences:",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "unordered-list",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "Scroll-triggered animations: Libraries like ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://scrollmagic.io/"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "ScrollMagic",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " or ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://scrollytelling.basement.studio/"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "Scrollytelling",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " trigger animations based on the scroll position, creating engaging storytelling and visual effects as users scroll through the page. An effect that is also based on the scroll position is the parallax effect, which creates a sense of depth by moving background and foreground elements at different speeds during scrolling.",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "3d Animations: ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebGL_API"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "WebGL",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " makes complex 3D graphics and animations possible, suitable for advanced visual effects and interactive experiences. A Framework based on WebGL, that is a bit easier to use and offers some presets is ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://threejs.org/"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "three.js",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": ". An example for this is the ascii globe animation on the landing page of this website, which uses the ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://threejs.org/examples/#webgl_effects_ascii"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "ascii effect",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " by ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "uri": "https://threejs.org/"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "three.js",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " ;)",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
