          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Accessibility",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Even tho animations can be a lot of fun to look for a lot of people, they might not be for everybody. Some users experience distraction or nausea from animated content. For example, if scrolling a page causes elements to move (other than the essential movement associated with scrolling) it can trigger vestibular disorders. Blinking and flashing animation can be problematic for people with cognitive concerns. Additionally, certain kinds of motion can be a trigger for vestibular disorders, epilepsy, and migraine and scotopic sensitivity.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Consider providing a mechanism for pausing or disabling animation as well as using the ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "uri": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/prefers-reduced-motion"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Reduced Motion Media Query",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " to create a complimentary experience for users who have expressed a preference for reduced animated experiences. This will make your website  ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
